  "speechText": "I O-heavy tasks spend most of their time waiting, for example database queries, network requests, or file operations. Node.js handles these tasks well because it does not need to block the main thread while waiting. CPU-heavy tasks use a lot of CPU time, for example image processing or complex calculations. They can block the event loop, so I would move them to worker threads, a queue, or another service.",
